Developed an interactive Weather Dashboard in Power BI using real-time weather data to analyze temperature, humidity, wind speed, precipitation, and climate patterns through dynamic visualizations and data-driven insights.

The dashboard includes KPI cards, trend analysis, and location-based weather comparisons to provide a comprehensive overview of changing weather conditions. Interactive filters and charts enhance user experience by enabling deeper analysis of seasonal patterns, forecast trends, and environmental metrics.

Implemented data cleaning and transformation using Power Query to ensure accurate reporting and optimized dashboard performance for smooth and responsive visualization.
